'''War on Valentines''' (僕らのバレンタイン戦争, ''Bokura no Barentain Sensō'', '''Our Valentine's Day War''') is the Valentine's Day event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]].

==Event Information==
Will this be the year you receive the gift of true love? The Battle Cats' Valentine's Day event is on now!
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On from March 2nd (11:00am) until March 16th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Limited Valentines Day Stages and Events!'''}}<br>
A sweet selection of limited stages!<br>
Stage clear rewards {{Color|#FF0000|'''reset'''}}!<br>
During this event, visit the Legend Stages/Event Stages from The Battle Cats title menu and select the named maps below to take on these challenges.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・"Attack of the Lonely Hearts" now available!'''}}<br>
Face off against a rampaging gang of unrequited chocolates!<br>
Reward(s): Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, Catamin (A, B, C), and more!<br>
※ This stage will appear after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 1.<br>
※Once all stage attempts have been used, you will be able to retry after a certain amount of time has passed.<br>
※Using a Catamin A will immediately grant another stage attempt.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・The "From Your Crush" series of stages are now available!'''}}<br>
2 vs 2 special stages, just for Valentine's!<br>
Then on March 6th at 11:00am, and again on March 9th at 11:00am, more stages will appear!<br>
Reward(s): Cat Ticket, Battle Items

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・"War on Valentine's" now available!'''}}<br>
Clear this stage for a small chance to earn Marshmallow Cat.<br>
※ Use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance of unlocking this character.<br>
※ This character cannot be unlocked again if earned from a previous event.<br>
※ After unlocking this character, activate it by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・New Map "Bittersweet Valentine's" appears from Day 10!'''}}<br>
Will true love smile upon lovestruck lads awaiting the chocolates of romance?<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On from March 11th (11:00am) until March 16th (10:59am)!'''}}

Reward(s): Catfruit (Purple, Red, Blue, Green, Yellow, Epic), XP<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Stages above will appear after you have cleared Empire of Cats Ch. 1, and be available to challenge after you have cleared Empire of Cats Ch. 3.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#34A853|'''Up to 14 Limited Valentine's Event Daily Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Reward(s): Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, and more!

